kstars for Debian

Upstream distribution is splitted in 3 packages for binaries, arch-indep data and doc.
However, starting from version 3.7.7, KStars complete documentation is not included in the sources anymore. As a result, kstars-doc package  contains the full documentation only for a few languages.

To reach the complete KStars Handbook, available in different languages, please visit:

    https://kstars-docs.kde.org

